<report>
<line><title>Quantile confidence interval</title></line>
<line><block name="variable"></line>
<line>Variable: <in>sample</in></line>
<line>Sample size = <in>size</in></line>
<line>Quantile (<in>quantile_name</in>) = <in>value</in></line>
<line><ci>Approximate <in>pc</in>% CI <in>type</in> = <in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci></line>
<line>Exact confidence level = <in>exact</in></line>
<line></block></line>
<line></line>
</report>
